          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```txt\n(c) 27 – (18 + 4) and 27 + ( – 18 – 4)\n27 – (18 + 4) = 27 – 18 – 4 = 5\n27 + ( – 18 – 4) = 27 – 18 – 4 = 5\nSo, 27 – (18 + 4) = 27 + ( – 18 – 4)\n```",
